          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-1 font-sans\">\n  <div class=\"bg-[#c9f3f4] border-2 border-[#151b20] p-3 rounded-xl shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] mb-2 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase text-[#0e7490]\">Capstone Synthesis • Slide 16</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-base font-black text-[#151b20]\">The Four Golden Rules of Extended Sampling</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono bg-[#fffdf7] text-[#151b20] px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-[#151b20] font-black\">\n      Lesson 2.7 Complete\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-1\">\n    <div class=\"bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] p-3 rounded-xl shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono font-black text-xs text-[#0e7490] mb-1\">\n        <span>1️⃣</span> Rule 1: Audit Spectral Periodicity\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-[#151b20]/85 leading-relaxed\">\n        Verify $\\gcd(k, P) = 1$ or shuffle index sequence to avoid phase-locked estimation bias on cyclic data.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] p-3 rounded-xl shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono font-black text-xs text-[#047857] mb-1\">\n        <span>2️⃣</span> Rule 2: Algorithm R for Unbounded Streams\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-[#151b20]/85 leading-relaxed\">\n        Deploy Vitter's reservoir sampling for provable $\\Pr = k/N$ inclusion with strictly bounded $\\mathcal{O}(k)$ memory.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] p-3 rounded-xl shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono font-black text-xs text-[#b45309] mb-1\">\n        <span>3️⃣</span> Rule 3: De-bias Snowballs via RDS\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-[#151b20]/85 leading-relaxed\">\n        Weight peer referral respondents inversely by network degree ($w_i = 1/d_i$) to eliminate hub over-sampling.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] p-3 rounded-xl shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono font-black text-xs text-[#dc2626] mb-1\">\n        <span>4️⃣</span> Rule 4: Adapt &amp; Bootstrap Rare Clusters\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-[#151b20]/85 leading-relaxed\">\n        Deploy Thompson spatial expansion on rare hotspots and non-parametric bootstrap for empirical confidence bounds.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-[#e7f4c8] border-2 border-[#151b20] p-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20] flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#151b20]\">\n      🚀 Up Next: Lesson 2.8: Modern Collection Tooling Stacks (Headless Scrapers, Scrapy Pipelines &amp; Distributed Ingestion).\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono bg-[#151b20] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-black\">\n      Next: Lesson 2.8 →\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
          "speaker": "Dr. Nova & Kaito"
